      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "必殺を放つ剣士こそ、究極の兵種だって奴がいるが、\n神話の時代にでも生きてるのかって話さ。\n今は騎兵こそが最強だって教えてやるよ……\n特に剣士は血祭りだ。かかってきな！",
        "official_en": "Some say the critical strikes of myrmidons make\nthem the truest of warriors. Bah! This is no longer\nthe era of legends. Cavalry is far superior in our\nmodern age. Allow me to demonstrate!",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
