      },
      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "戦いに究極や最強なんてないって？\nわかってる、そんなのわかってるんだ。\n死んだ親父は剣士だった。親父は弱くなかった。\nもっと強い奴がいただけ……そう思いたいのかもな。",
        "official_en": "There is no need to declare the truest of warriors...is\nthat what you think? You have a point. My father\nwas a myrmidon in his day, and strong too. But\nsomeone else was stronger, or he'd have lived.",
        "real_en": null
      },
